---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import housePhoto from '../assets/619_oak.jpg';
---

<Layout
	title="Formosa Founders House"
	description="舊金山的台灣創業者之家, A Taiwanese Founder House in San Francisco"
	image={housePhoto.src}
>

	<!-- Hero: full-bleed photo, Ken Burns, text centered -->
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-photo" style={`background-image: url(${housePhoto.src})`}></div>
		<div class="hero-overlay">
			<a href="/" class="founder-link">Founded by David Day</a>
			<div class="hero-content">
				<p class="eyebrow">San Francisco · Lower Haight</p>
				<h1>Formosa<br/>Founders House</h1>
				<p class="subtitle">The home and harbor for Taiwanese founders in San Francisco</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="scroll-hint">
			<span>Scroll</span>
			<div class="scroll-line"></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Editorial sections -->
	<main class="editorial">

		<div class="ed-section">
			<div class="ed-label">
				<span class="ed-name">What Is This Place</span>
			</div>
			<div class="ed-content">
				<p>Formosa Founders House is a hacker house in San Francisco where Taiwanese startup founders live together under one roof. Think of it as a shared home where you don't just get a room — you get direct access to experienced founders, their networks, and the Silicon Valley ecosystem.</p>
				<p>Formosa Founders House 是台灣創業者的 hacker house — 一個實際住在一起的共居空間。你不只是租一個房間，而是加入一個由創業者組成的家，直接連結到矽谷的人脈和資源。</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="ed-section">
			<div class="ed-label">
				<span class="ed-name">What We Offer</span>
			</div>
			<div class="ed-content">
				<div class="offer-list">
					<div class="offer-item">
						<span class="offer-mark">—</span>
						<div>
							<strong>Live with proven founders</strong>
							<p>你的室友是 YC 和 500 Global 等頂級 VC 投資的創業者</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="offer-item">
						<span class="offer-mark">—</span>
						<div>
							<strong>Learn from those who've done it</strong>
							<p>直接學習如何 fundraise、找客戶、在矽谷生存</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="offer-item">
						<span class="offer-mark">—</span>
						<div>
							<strong>Get intros that matter</strong>
							<p>透過室友的人脈接觸到投資人和重要資源</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="offer-item">
						<span class="offer-mark">—</span>
						<div>
							<strong>Move fast</strong>
							<p>別人花一年摸索的事，你幾週就懂</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="offer-item">
						<span class="offer-mark">—</span>
						<div>
							<strong>Feel at home</strong>
							<p>火鍋、茶葉蛋、中秋烤肉——在異鄉也有家的感覺</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="ed-section">
			<div class="ed-label">
				<span class="ed-name">Why It Matters</span>
			</div>
			<div class="ed-content">
				<p>台灣創業者來舊金山很辛苦。這裡的創業圈子很緊密，但要打進去很難——尤其是語言和文化障礙。</p>
				<p>大部分人花一年以上才搞清楚這裡怎麼運作，燒錢燒時間，還感到孤立無援。</p>
				<p>Formosa House 直接讓你和走過類似的路、或正在走同樣的路的人住在一起。你不需要慢慢 network ——你已經在裡面了。</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="ed-section">
			<div class="ed-label">
				<span class="ed-name">Who Thrives Here</span>
			</div>
			<div class="ed-content">
				<div class="thrive-list">
					<div class="thrive-item">
						<h3>你正在 Build 東西</h3>
						<p>創業、開源專案、研究、創作、認真的 side project——我們歡迎所有 builders。我們看重的是你的熱情和你正在做的事，而不是你的 title 或背景。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="thrive-item">
						<h3>你對自己有期待</h3>
						<p>你知道自己要什麼，也願意為此努力。你是自我驅動的——不需要別人督促，因為你本來就熱愛你在做的事。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="thrive-item">
						<h3>你相信互相幫助</h3>
						<p>這個社群的魔力來自於每個人的付出與分享。煮飯、辦活動、介紹人脈、分享經驗——當你有能力的時候，自然會想要回饋。</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="ed-section">
			<div class="ed-label">
				<span class="ed-name">Daily Life</span>
			</div>
			<div class="ed-content">
				<div class="life-grid">
					<div class="life-card">
						<h3>工作日</h3>
						<p>各自出門工作或在家 deep work。沒有規定，沒有壓力。偶爾在廚房遇到，聊聊最近在做什麼、遇到什麼困難。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="life-card">
						<h3>晚餐時光</h3>
						<p>有人煮飯就一起吃，沒人煮就各自解決或一起叫外賣。不強制，但總有機會坐下來，聊聊今天發生的事。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="life-card">
						<h3>週末聚會</h3>
						<p>有時候會辦個小型聚會，邀請其他在矽谷的台灣創業者。分享經驗、互相幫忙、或純粹認識新朋友。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="life-card">
						<h3>互相支持</h3>
						<p>Demo day 前幫忙練習、募資時給建議、失落時有人聽你說話。不是導師關係，而是同在創業路上的夥伴。</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="ed-section">
			<div class="ed-label">
				<span class="ed-name">House Rules</span>
			</div>
			<div class="ed-content">
				<div class="rules-list">
					<div class="rule-item">
						<span class="rule-num">I</span>
						<div>
							<h3>Bet on yourself.</h3>
							<p>創業就是押注自己。不要等完美時機，不要等別人點頭，不要等準備好了再開始。Execution is everything — 想法沒有價值，執行才有。</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="rule-item">
						<span class="rule-num">II</span>
						<div>
							<h3>Talk about what works.</h3>
							<p>我們這裡不批評、不抱怨。當你遇到問題，帶著你的解法來找人討論——Solution-oriented 是我們的文化。</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="rule-item">
						<span class="rule-num">III</span>
						<div>
							<h3>No ego at the door.</h3>
							<p>不管你是 pre-idea 還是 post-Series A，在這裡大家都是平等的。每個人都有值得學習的地方。把 status 留在門外。</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="rule-item">
						<span class="rule-num">IV</span>
						<div>
							<h3>Default to action.</h3>
							<p>卡住的時候，選一個方向，動起來。你從行動中學到的，永遠比從猶豫中多。</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="ed-section">
			<div class="ed-label">
				<span class="ed-name">Rent & Amenities</span>
			</div>
			<div class="ed-content">
				<p class="rent-price">USD 1,500–2,000 <span>/ month</span></p>
				<p>Our goal is to create a living environment that allows founders to focus fully on their work. Rent includes shared services such as regular professional cleaning and other arrangements finalized with incoming residents.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="ed-section">
			<div class="ed-label">
				<span class="ed-name">Location</span>
			</div>
			<div class="ed-content">
				<p>Lower Haight — walking distance to Duboce Park, Castro, and Hayes Valley. Easy Muni access to SoMa, Mission, and Downtown SF.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

	</main>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="cta-inner">
			<p class="cta-eyebrow">Want to Join?</p>
			<p class="cta-body">
				如果你是台灣創業者，正在或即將來舊金山，<br/>
				歡迎填寫表單讓我們認識你。<br/>
				我們會跟你聊聊，看看彼此是否適合。
			</p>
			<a
				href="https://forms.gle/Mk6ZZzWXZJZMMeNW7"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="cta-button"
				data-simple-event="residency_apply"
			>填寫申請表單</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	/* ─── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────── */

	.hero {
		position: relative;
		height: 100vh;
		min-height: 560px;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: #000;
	}

	.hero-photo {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background-size: cover;
		background-position: center top;
	}

	.hero-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: linear-gradient(
			to bottom,
			rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0%,
			rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 50%,
			rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75) 100%
		);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 0 2rem;
	}

	.founder-link {
		position: absolute;
		top: 2rem;
		left: 2.5rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	.founder-link:hover {
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.hero-content {
		color: #fff;
		max-width: 760px;
	}

	.subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
		font-style: italic;
		opacity: 0.8;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.22em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		opacity: 0.6;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.hero-content h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		line-height: 1.05;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.scroll-hint {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 2.5rem;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		opacity: 0.4;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.scroll-hint span {
		font-size: 0.62rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.scroll-line {
		width: 1px;
		height: 48px;
		background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #fff, transparent);
		animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	@keyframes scrollPulse {
		0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; }
		50%       { opacity: 1; }
	}

	/* ─── Editorial Layout ───────────────────────────────── */

	.editorial {
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.ed-section {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		padding: 4.5rem 4rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.ed-label {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding-top: 0.2rem;
		position: sticky;
		top: 3rem;
	}

	.ed-name {
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.ed-content {
		max-width: 65ch;
		padding-left: 3rem;
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
	}

	.ed-content p {
		font-size: clamp(0.975rem, 1.4vw, 1.0625rem);
		line-height: 1.9;
		font-weight: 300;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.ed-content p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.ed-content strong {
		font-weight: 500;
		color: #fff;
	}

	/* ─── Offer List ─────────────────────────────────────── */

	.offer-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.offer-item {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.25rem 1fr;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.offer-mark {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
		font-size: 1rem;
		padding-top: 0.05rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.offer-item strong {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.975rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.offer-item p {
		font-size: 0.875rem !important;
		line-height: 1.7 !important;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72) !important;
		margin: 0 !important;
	}

	/* ─── Thrive List ───────────────────────────────────── */

	.thrive-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}

	.thrive-item h3 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	.thrive-item p {
		font-size: 0.975rem !important;
	}

	/* ─── Daily Life Grid ───────────────────────────────── */

	.life-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 1px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
	}

	.life-card {
		background: #000;
		padding: 2rem;
		transition: background 0.3s ease;
	}

	.life-card:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
	}

	.life-card h3 {
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.life-card p {
		font-size: 0.9rem !important;
		line-height: 1.85 !important;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84) !important;
		margin: 0 !important;
	}

	/* ─── House Rules ───────────────────────────────────── */

	.rules-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.rule-item {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		padding: 2rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.rule-item:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
		padding-bottom: 0;
	}

	.rule-item:first-child {
		padding-top: 0;
	}

	.rule-num {
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		font-style: italic;
		padding-top: 0.2rem;
	}

	.rule-item h3 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	/* ─── Rent ──────────────────────────────────────────── */

	.rent-price {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) !important;
		font-weight: 300 !important;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em !important;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
		color: #fff !important;
		line-height: 1.1 !important;
	}

	.rent-price span {
		font-size: 0.45em;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: 400;
		vertical-align: middle;
	}

	/* ─── Map ───────────────────────────────────────────── */

	.map-embed {
		margin-top: 1.75rem;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
	}

	.map-embed iframe {
		display: block;
		filter: grayscale(55%) invert(90%) contrast(88%);
	}

	/* ─── CTA ───────────────────────────────────────────── */

	.cta {
		background: #f4efe6;
		color: #000;
		padding: 9rem 4rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.cta-inner {
		max-width: 520px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.cta-eyebrow {
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.26em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.cta-body {
		font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		line-height: 1.85;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
	}

	.cta-button {
		display: inline-block;
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.15em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		border: 1.5px solid #000;
		transition: background 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
	}

	.cta-button:hover {
		background: transparent;
		color: #000;
		transform: translateY(-3px);
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	/* ─── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────────── */

	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.hero-overlay {
			padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
		}

		.ed-section {
			grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
			padding: 4rem 3rem;
		}

		.ed-content {
			padding-left: 2.5rem;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero {
			background-attachment: scroll;
			min-height: 480px;
		}

		.hero-overlay {
			padding: 2rem;
		}

		.founder-link {
			left: 1.5rem;
			top: 1.5rem;
		}

		.scroll-hint {
			display: none;
		}

		.ed-section {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
			gap: 0;
		}

		.ed-label {
			position: static;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 0.75rem;
			margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		}

		.ed-content {
			padding-left: 0;
			border-left: none;
			border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
			padding-top: 1.5rem;
		}

		.life-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.cta {
			padding: 6rem 2rem;
		}

	}
</style>
